# Clipper

Read `.kiro/steering/clipper.md` and `memories/repo/live-clipper-ast-graph.md`.

- Worker/API in `clipper/` — do not mutate `cmd/chat`, `cmd/video`, `cmd/metadata` for clip creation/rendering.
- UI: `ClipStudio.tsx` (`/studio/:jobId`) and Analytics clip tabs are API clients only.
- Jobs: SQLite queue, single worker, stale in-progress reclaim after `CLIPPER_STALE_JOB_SECONDS`.
- Resume from `raw_path` / `twitch_clip_url` — do not recreate Twitch clips on worker restart.
- Secrets stay in env; never log tokens or auth headers.
- Tests: `make clipper-test`. Auth scope needs `clips:edit` — `make twitch-local-auth`.
